    "body": "Problem:\r\nIf a snippet does not have a placeholder, we use insert mode instead of select mode. From here `<Esc>` leaves the session and highlight active.\r\n\r\nSolution:\r\nCancel the session on `<Esc>`.\r\n\r\nCloses #41554\r\n",
    "closed_at": "2026-08-30T12:32:56Z",
    "comment_data": [],
    "comment_regular_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Backport failed for `release-0.12`, because it was unable to cherry-pick the commit(s).\n\nPlease cherry-pick the changes locally and resolve any conflicts.\n```bash\ngit fetch origin release-0.12\ngit worktree add -d .worktree/backport-41555-to-release-0.12 origin/release-0.12\ncd .worktree/backport-41555-to-release-0.12\ngit switch --create backport-41555-to-release-0.12\ngit cherry-pick -x 39862231b2889db55568ad805f1885fd8cfc5248\n```",
